{
 "file": "02OLB05 base 0x2000",
 "entries": [
  {
   "id": "02OLB05:31c",
   "ptr": "0x31c",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "「た、大変です！　軍の連中が港に！\\n",
   "en": "\"Th-this is terrible! The army's at the port! Don't tell me they mean to run away...?\"",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB05:343",
   "ptr": "0x343",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　あいつら、まさか、逃げ出すつもり\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 02OLB05:31c"
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB05:36a",
   "ptr": "0x36a",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "  では・・・？」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 02OLB05:31c"
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB05:39f",
   "ptr": "0x39f",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「この倉庫はダンカン様の私設倉庫だ。\\n",
   "en": "\"This warehouse is Duncan-sama's private property. Off with you!\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB05:3c8",
   "ptr": "0x3c8",
   "len": 20,
   "jp": "　あっちへ行け！」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 20,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 02OLB05:39f"
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB05:412",
   "ptr": "0x412",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "「この国はもうお仕舞いだよ！\\n",
   "en": "\"This country's finished! We're gettin' out by ship!",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB05:433",
   "ptr": "0x433",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "　おれたちゃ、船で脱出するんだ！\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 02OLB05:412"
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB05:459",
   "ptr": "0x459",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "　残った市民など知ったこっちゃないね。\\n",
   "en": "Who cares about the folks left behind? Ain't no ship that big. Only the nobles and their guards get out.\"",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB05:484",
   "ptr": "0x484",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "　そんなに大勢、乗れる船があるもんか。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 02OLB05:459"
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB05:4af",
   "ptr": "0x4af",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "　脱出するのは貴族と護衛の兵士だけさ」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 02OLB05:459"
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB05:50d",
   "ptr": "0x50d",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "「城で行われていた会議の結果、貴族\\n",
   "en": "\"I hear the council at the castle decided the nobles will abandon this country and flee.",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB05:534",
   "ptr": "0x534",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "  たちはこの国を捨てて脱出すること\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 02OLB05:50d"
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB05:55b",
   "ptr": "0x55b",
   "len": 20,
   "jp": "  を決めたそうだ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 20,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 02OLB05:50d"
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB05:573",
   "ptr": "0x573",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　もっとも、ダンカン様などは、ずいぶ\\n",
   "en": "Mind you, Duncan-sama and his like seem to have been getting ready to run for a long time...",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB05:59c",
   "ptr": "0x59c",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  ん前から逃げ出す準備を進めてたよう\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 02OLB05:573"
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB05:5c5",
   "ptr": "0x5c5",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "  だがね・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 02OLB05:573"
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB05:5d9",
   "ptr": "0x5d9",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "　今、ダンカン様の屋敷に領主様を始め、\\n",
   "en": "Right now, the lord and all the noble bigwigs are gathered in secret at Duncan-sama's mansion. And the common folk left in Balkrutha don't know a thing. That's how it is.\"",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB05:604",
   "ptr": "0x604",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  貴族のお歴々が密かに集まってるぜ。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 02OLB05:5d9"
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB05:62d",
   "ptr": "0x62d",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　何も知らないのは、バルクルーサに残\\n",
